# Forbidden patterns in the team memory: extended regular expressions (grep -E).
# One pattern on each line. A line that starts with "#" is a comment.
# To change the patterns for your team, copy this file to .memory-check in the root of
# the team repository.
#
# Absolute paths in home directories
/home/[A-Za-z0-9._-]+
/Users/[A-Za-z0-9._-]+
/root/
# Home directory shortcuts
(^|[^A-Za-z0-9_.:/-])~/
\$HOME
%USERPROFILE%
# Windows drive letters and network shares
(^|[^A-Za-z0-9])[A-Za-z]:\\
\\\\[A-Za-z0-9._-]+\\
# Links to local files
file://
# Mount points and devices of one machine
/mnt/
/media/
/Volumes/
/dev/tty
/dev/cu\.
# Markdown links to absolute paths, or out of the memory directory
\]\((/|~|\.\./\.\.)
